        <li><a href="https://c2pa.org/specifications/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">C2PA Specifications</a>：JUMBF、manifest、签名与文件嵌入方式。</li>
        <li><a href="https://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/digitalsourcetype/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">IPTC Digital Source Type vocabulary</a>：<code>trainedAlgorithmicMedia</code> 等受控值的定义。</li>
        <li><a href="https://exiftool.org/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">ExifTool</a> 与 <a href="/research/ai-media-provenance-report-2026-q3/">AICheck365 2026 Q3 实验汇总</a>：用于复查文中的字段和真实样本结果。</li>
      </ul>

